      "id": "intro_1",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Had the writer's money been stolen?",
      "translation": "作者的钱被偷了吗？",
      "startTime": 10.39,
      "endTime": 15.32
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_2",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "I entered the hotel manager's office and sat down.",
      "translation": "我走进饭店经理的办公室，坐了下来。",
      "startTime": 15.33,
      "endTime": 20.12
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_3",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "I had just lost ￡50 and I felt very upset.",
      "translation": "我刚刚丢了50英镑，感到非常烦恼。",
      "startTime": 20.13,
      "endTime": 26.38,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Very",
            "pos": "adv.",
            "meaning": "很，非常"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_4",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "'I left the money in my room,' I said, 'and it's not there now.  '",
      "translation": "'我把钱放在房间里，'我说，'现在找不到了。'",
      "startTime": 26.39,
      "endTime": 33.32,
      "analysis": {
